    <div>
      <h2>404 - Page Not Found</h2>
      <p>The page you're looking for doesn't exist.</p>
      <Link to="/">Go to Home</Link>
    </div>
  );
}

export default NotFound;
```

- The `*` path matches any unmatched route.
- Always include a 404 page for better UX.

> ✅ Accessibility: Ensure your 404 page includes a link back to the homepage and has proper heading structure.

